%% State Diagram — Patient Status (PATIENTS.patient_status)
%% Updated: 2026-05-18 (English labels)
%% PATIENT_STATUS lookup: 0=Waiting, 1=Examining, 2=Admitted, 3=Discharged
%% Re-examination: status=3 returning resets to 0

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Waiting : Create record

    Waiting : 0 — Waiting
    Examining : 1 — Examining
    Admitted : 2 — Admitted
    Discharged : 3 — Discharged

    Waiting --> Examining : Doctor starts examination
    Examining --> Discharged : Treated as outpatient
    Examining --> Admitted : Decide to admit
    Admitted --> Discharged : Discharge
    Discharged --> Waiting : Re-examination
    Discharged --> [*] : Patient does not return
